            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, you can create a buffer-local mapping which acts like built-in `'`. This can be done in autocommand for `FileType` event. I recommend creating 'after/ftplugin/verilog.lua' file in your config directory and add `vim.keymap.set('i', \"'\", \"'\", { buffer = 0 })` call there.",
